reason: Lacci's Image keeps the file name in a url style and has no path method (C5 rules path an alias of url).
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @logo = image "assets/red-40x30.png"
end
----------- test code
assert_equal "assets/red-40x30.png", image("@logo").path, "path is the image's file name"
